5,0,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I hope we can all get along and find the werewolf peacefully.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A noble sentiment, Minato. Though I suspect the werewolf might have a slightly different agenda for us.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,Patience and observation are our best tools. Let us listen to one another with open hearts.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,I'm sure I'll be able to spot the liar in no time. This should be fun!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I don't care about ""fun."" Let's just find the monster and get rid of it quickly.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, you seem very determined. That's brave of you.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. Such passion is refreshing, if a bit impulsive.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,"Energy is a gift, but remember that a rushing river often misses the stones beneath.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,"@Servas, you're always so poetic. Are you trying to distract us with philosophy?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,I'm not being impulsive! I just want to win.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,Does anyone have any theories yet? It's only the first day.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It is far too early for theories, but I am observing how everyone reacts to the pressure.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,I agree. The truth often reveals itself in the quiet moments between words.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,"I think Benjamin is being a bit too mysterious. It's almost suspicious, isn't it?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@May, he's just talking. Stop guessing and start thinking.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,I'll just try my best to help everyone.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"I appreciate that, Minato. Let us see what the first night brings.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Servas,,May the night be revealing for those who seek the truth.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,May,,I'll be dreaming of victory!,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
