32,1,1,talk,Minato,,Good morning. I hope everyone slept well.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"I slept quite well, thank you. In fact, I woke up with a very clear realization.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Servas,,A realization can be a blessing or a burden. Would you share it?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,May,,"Oh, is the mysterious Benjamin finally going to tell us something useful?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Takumi,,Just say it already! Who is it?,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, you sound like you know something. What is it?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I am the Seer. And I'm afraid Minato, your innocent face is a mask for a wolf.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Servas,,"That is a heavy accusation. Minato, what do you have to say?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,May,,"Wow, right out of the gate! Benjamin, are you sure? Or are you just playing a game?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"If he's the Seer, we have our target. Minato, explain yourself!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Minato,,What? No! I'm not a werewolf! Benjamin is lying to us!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Logic suggests that a werewolf would deny it. Your panic is quite telling, Minato.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Servas,,It is difficult to discern the truth when two people contradict each other so sharply.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,May,,"I don't know... Minato does seem genuinely surprised. Benjamin, you're very confident.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I trust the Seer. Minato, you're acting way too scared.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Minato,,Please believe me! I'm just a villager!,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I have no reason to lie. The evidence of my vision is absolute.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Servas,,"If we execute an innocent, we lose a valuable ally. But if we keep a wolf, we all perish.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,May,,I'm leaning towards Benjamin. He's too calm to be making this up for fun.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm voting for Minato. Let's end this now.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
